OL,3,GNEWSAFresh drought measures to protect
OL,4,Adrinking water
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohn Halsall, South East Water CEO,
OL,7,Fsaid: "Under this new agreement, we
OL,8,Fwill reduce the rate of release in a
OL,9,Fmanaged, phased manner day-by-day."
